\newlabel{tab:disruption}{{4}{13}{Disruption cost by severity, committed sample (900--909), normalised reward. $\dagger $: not individually computed beyond the qualitative accelerating pattern common to every arm (see text). $\ddagger $: agent churn does not apply to a single-agent architecture}{table.4}{}}
